# Ulamog, the Defiler. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and its cast trigger has Bot2 exile the top half of its nine-card library,
# rounded up: five cards, the greatest of them a Counterspell of mana value 2, so Ulamog enters with two +1/+1 counters
# (9/9). On turn 2 Bot2 Lightning Bolts it with four permanents: Ulamog's "Ward--Sacrifice two permanents" (CR 702.21a)
# asks it to pay, and it sacrifices the two Moxen it chooses; the Bolt resolves. On turn 3 Ulamog attacks: annihilator X
# with X its two counters (CR 702.86a), and Bot2, left with exactly two permanents, sacrifices both, then takes 9.

